  "description": "HOTXUL crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H64 N8 O18 Yb4,C3 H7 N1 O1. From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 4 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.582-3.827 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.39-108.15°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C87H71N9O19Yb4.",
